Item | Answer
Return on equity, closing basis | 9.15 per cent: 283,500 ÷ 3,100,000.
Retention ratio | 100 per cent, because no dividend was declared.
Sustainable growth rate | 9.15 per cent: 9.15 × 1.00 = 9.15.
Actual sales growth | 11.0 per cent: 21,978,000 − 19,800,000 = 2,178,000, and 2,178,000 ÷ 19,800,000 = 11.0 per cent.
