B is wrong. That is the retention ratio.
C is wrong. This is dividends over sales.
D is wrong. That is the sustainable growth rate.
P15-03  Answer A. A lower payout raises retention and so raises the rate.
B is wrong. Issuing shares funds growth from outside; it does not raise the sustainable rate.
C is wrong. Selling a division changes the business.
D is wrong. A longer cash cycle consumes cash and makes matters worse.
